  "sourceTitle": "Creamy Chicken Fettuccine",
  "sourceText": "Creamy Chicken Fettuccine\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 12:44am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 (9 oz.) pkg. spinach fettuccine\n3/4 cup heavy cream\n2 tablespoons Dijon mustard\n1 1/2 cups cooked chicken, cubed\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In large pot cook noodles until tender, 2 to 3 minutes. Add cream and mustard. Cook over medium heat about 2 minutes. Mix in chicken. Heat through. Serves 4.",
